Training data includes, alongside synthetic text, the following public
corpora, all released under CC BY 4.0 (attribution given here):

  Swedish NER Corpus (klintan / Webbnyheter 2012)
  https://github.com/klintan/swedish-ner-corpus

  SUCX 3.0 NER (KBLab remix of SUC 3.0, Språkbanken Text)
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/KBLab/sucx3_ner
  https://spraakbanken.gu.se/en/resources/suc3

  MASSIVE 1.1, sv-SE subset (Amazon Science)
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/AmazonScience/massive

  SIC2, Stockholm Internet Corpus (Språkbanken Text)
  https://spraakbanken.gu.se/en/resources/sic2

  MultiCoNER v2, Swedish subset (SemEval-2023 shared task)
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/MultiCoNER/multiconer_v2

  Flashback and Familjeliv forum corpora (Språkbanken Text exports;
  pseudo-labeled register sample, v14 round)
  https://spraakbanken.gu.se/en/resources/flashback-dator
  https://spraakbanken.gu.se/en/resources/familjeliv-allmanna-ekonomi
